| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| Domain | Combat |
| Lifecycle | Static |
| Passive | Frozen duration +0.2 s per application. While Frozen: restore **30% of post-mitigation direct damage** received from enemies (effectively: Frozen = lifesteal against incoming hits). |
| Skill | **Combat.** Grant oneself 60 Frozen stacks. |
| CD | 30 s (second-based) |
| Tags | — |

### 7.7 Yukai's Rope

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| Domain | Combat |
| Lifecycle | Static |
| Passive | While in the air: **+30 DEF**. |
| Skill | **Combat.** Fire a rope 20 m forward. On hitting the first obstacle (wall, ground, platform), the player is **dragged** to the impact point. |
| CD | 30 s (second-based) |
| Tags | — |

### 7.8 Pixolotl's Feather

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| Domain | Hybrid |
| Lifecycle | Single-use → Convertible |
| Passive | Gravity reduced by **20%**. |
| Skill | **Map — single use.** Flash back to **one day earlier** (undo the current day's consequences: stamina spent, damage taken, node entered — exact undo scope TBD). Then converts to **Pixolotl's Wish**. |
| CD | — (single use) |
| Tags | `Convertible` |

> **Design note:** "Flash back one day" is a powerful time-rewind mechanic. The scope
> of what gets undone (day counter? VOID devour? item cooldowns? foe levels?) needs
> precise specification before implementation. The safest interpretation: the day
> counter does **not** rewind (time only flows forward for the VOID), but the player's
> position, HP, and stamina revert to their start-of-day state.

> **Built (v0.12.8), the safest interpretation:** a map button (shown while a team member
> holds the Feather) asks once, then returns you to **this morning** — the start-of-day
> snapshot TwistedReality also uses: where you stood (unless the VOID has eaten it since),
> every fighter's HP and the stamina. The day count, the VOID, conquests, rewards, items and
> cooldowns stay as they are. The Feather becomes Pixolotl's Wish in its slot. In a fight
> **F** says it is used on the map. The passive is gravity ×0.8 (Feather and Wish).

